		"en": [
			"• For those of you who want to take photos without using batteries just by waiting!",
			"• No batteries required! A spy camera that can take pictures using only sunlight!",
			"• The tissue box camera that appears in the TV program \"Pochitto Invention Pikachin Kit\" has been commercialized!",
